statement:
Let P, n ∈ ℕ, let U ⊆ ℝ^P be any set, let T ∈ D_n(U) (GeometricCurrentOn U n), and let M ⊆ ℝ^P, θ : ℝ^P → ℝ and ξ : ℝ^P → Λ_n(ℝ^P) (NVector) satisfy IsRectifiableTriple U n M θ ξ. That is:
- M ⊆ U is Hⁿ-null-measurable and countably n-rectifiable;
- θ(x) > 0 for x ∈ M, and θ is Hⁿ-integrable on M ∩ K for every compact K ⊆ U;
- ξ is Hⁿ⌞M-a.e. strongly measurable;
- for Hⁿ-a.e. x ∈ M there is an orthonormal τ : Fin n → ℝ^P such that span τ is a weighted approximate tangent space of (M, θ) at x and ξ(x) = ±τ₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ τₙ (= ±simpleNVector τ).
If T(ω) = τ(M, θ, ξ)(ω) = ∫_M θ(x)·ξ(x)(ω(x)) dHⁿ(x) for every ω ∈ Dⁿ(U), then Hⁿ(M ∖ spt T) = 0. Here Hⁿ = μHE[n], and spt T = T.support = U ∖ T.zeroRegion, where T.zeroRegion is the union of all open W with closure W compact and contained in U such that T(ψ) = 0 for every ψ ∈ Dⁿ(U) with tsupport ψ ⊆ W.
